{"title":"How Old Electromechanical Pinball Machines Work","link":"https://how-old-pinball-machines-work.mattmakai.com/","date":1795624764000,"content":"<a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50644301\">Comments</a><div class=\"hn-comments\"><div class=\"hn-comment\"><p class=\"hn-comment-meta\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=Dwedit\">Dwedit</a> · <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50680127\">Nov 28, 2026</a></p><div class=\"hn-comment-body\">Technology Connections also did a good video on how electromechanical pinball machines work.</div></div><div class=\"hn-comment\"><p class=\"hn-comment-meta\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=matheusmoreira\">matheusmoreira</a> · <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50680156\">Nov 28, 2026</a></p><div class=\"hn-comment-body\">Technology Connections has made wonderful videos about electromechanical pinballs.<p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/E3p_Cv32tEo\">https://youtu.be/E3p_Cv32tEo</a></p></div></div><div class=\"hn-comment\"><p class=\"hn-comment-meta\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=WalterBright\">WalterBright</a> · <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50680163\">Nov 28, 2026</a></p><div class=\"hn-comment-body\">The electromechanical ones are a lot more fun because of the noises they make and the erratic behavior of them.</div></div></div>","author":"","comments":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50644301","siteTitle":"Hacker News","siteHash":"37bb545430005dba450c1e40307450d8e4e791b434e83f3d38915ebad510fd50","entryHash":"754518f0116f49bd182c0d0d562399f6993b9a539a220c9489915399564aa24d","category":"Tech"}